# QIDI Q2 firmware archive — git attributes
#
# No Git LFS. The large / binary payload is NOT committed: it ships as a per-release
# bundle (see assets-manifest.json + scripts/rehydrate.py). This repo is the lean text
# tree + that manifest.
#
# Preserve every byte: never convert line endings, on commit or checkout, regardless of
# the cloner's core.autocrlf. Text files still diff normally (git detects binary content
# by NUL bytes); the small binary blobs under package/ stay byte-exact.
*  -text
